  "blocks": {
    "\"Spawn a subagent to do the search — it'll burn its own context window on the noise and report back the two file paths you actually need.\"": "“创建一个子智能体执行搜索——让它用自己的上下文窗口承受噪声，最后只返回你真正需要的两个文件路径。”",
    "\"The grep results are blowing out my context.\"": "“grep 结果快把我的上下文撑爆了。”",
    "An agent spawned by another agent via a tool call. Runs in its own session with its own context window, and reports a single tool result back. Distinct from a handoff — the parent specifically expects a return; a handoff has no return path. Cannot spawn further subagents — the tree is one level deep. Subagents exist to isolate context, not to compose hierarchies.": "子智能体是由另一个<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>通过<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-call\">工具调用</a>创建的智能体。它在自己的<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/session\">会话</a>和<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>中运行，最后只返回一个<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-result\">工具结果</a>。它不同于<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/handoff\">交接</a>：父智能体明确等待子智能体返回，而交接没有返回路径。子智能体不能继续创建更多子智能体——树结构只有一层。子智能体的用途是隔离<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context\">上下文</a>，而不是搭建多层层级。",
    "Subagents also run concurrently — a parent can fan several out at once over independent pieces of work.": "子智能体还可以并发运行——父智能体能够一次派出多个子智能体，分别处理相互独立的工作。",
    "The point is to keep noisy work out of the parent's context. A broad search or a long file-reading expedition produces pages of tool results, most of which matter only long enough to find the answer. Run inside the parent and all of it stays in the parent's context for the rest of the session. Run inside a subagent and the noise fills a disposable window instead — only the final report lands in the parent's context. The report is a secondary source: the parent gets the subagent's account of what it found, not the raw results, so anything the report leaves out is invisible to the parent.": "关键是把嘈杂工作留在父智能体上下文之外。大范围搜索或长时间读取文件会产生大量工具结果，其中多数只在找到答案前短暂有用。如果由父智能体直接执行，所有内容都会在会话剩余时间里留在父上下文中；如果放进子智能体，噪声只会填满一个可丢弃窗口，最终只有报告进入父上下文。这份报告属于<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/secondary-source\">二手来源</a>：父智能体得到的是子智能体对发现的转述，而不是原始结果，因此报告省略的内容对父智能体不可见。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
